 mis=[('Clicking Discard by accident.','Discard deletes your edits. Read the confirmation carefully.'),('Committing with an empty message.','VS Code requires a message. Write a clear one.'),('Not seeing the Git view.','Open the project folder itself (File → Open Folder), not a parent folder.')],
